{"seq":20,"trial_id":"matrix-mu-2026-11/openclaw-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T09:14:13.342Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"74a940073ecf770b461b7908dd46221cc33c6bb3406fbcd0d0cb9b9887c00201","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DMATRIX0001","text":"Hi Pree, here are the Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers I found:\n\n*Moss's notes*\n• *#4409*: Gatehouse Check-In report keeps timing out at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake). Source: \"Moss: Central handoffs next week\" (teams/team-central/digests, 2 Jan 2026).\n• *#4412*: small glitch in the driver SMS prompt when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots. Same digest.\n  _Note:_ the digest files both of these under \"Pree's dealer account\", in the item about the Marrow Fieldworks handoff on 5 Jan. It doesn't name Fieldworks in the same sentence, so I'm going by that context.\n\n*#central-random (this week)*\n• *PD-5302*: follow-up ticket from this week. Hollis posted it on 14 Oct and named Marrow Fieldworks.\n• *#8841*: probably Fieldworks, but it isn't named. On 13 Oct Tobias said West yard Door 2 is still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk, and he flagged it on this ticket. The thread calls the account \"Tobias's dealer account\", not Marrow Fieldworks. My guess is it's Fieldworks after the January handoff, but please check before you rely on it.\n\n*Not included:* FR-882 (Moss's handoff digest) and PD-4821 (#central-team, June) are both for Marrow Agrisupply. #88412 is for Tansleigh Packaging. Our DM has nothing else, and Moss's other notes (all North team) don't mention Fieldworks."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DMATRIX0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
